  {
   "id": "text77",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1320,
   "y": 105,
   "width": 374.00000000000006,
   "height": 658.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 1,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 155,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 156,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "How it flows\n\n① Pet appears\nClaude Desktop starts the MCP server\n→ it launches IdlePaws.app\n→ WindowTracker finds Claude's window\n→ InputBarLocator finds the Prompt box\n→ Overlay draws the pet standing on it\n\n② 🎮 Games button\nright-click pet → console → Games\n→ BrowserPaneOpener clicks Claude's\n   Browser button, types localhost:4747\n→ menu page reads /games.json\n→ click a card → game site opens\n\n③ Ask Claude\n\"add murdoku.com to my games\"\n→ add_game tool → socket → GameList\n\"open game\" → open_game → menu URL\n\n④ Claude Code session ends\nStop hook → hook.js → socket \"react\"\n→ pet hops: \"Done! · project\"\n\n⑤ Shutdown\nClaude quits, or no MCP server\nconnected for 20s → app exits\n\nPet input: click = hearts · double-click\n= throw ball · right-click = console",
   "originalText": "How it flows\n\n① Pet appears\nClaude Desktop starts the MCP server\n→ it launches IdlePaws.app\n→ WindowTracker finds Claude's window\n→ InputBarLocator finds the Prompt box\n→ Overlay draws the pet standing on it\n\n② 🎮 Games button\nright-click pet → console → Games\n→ BrowserPaneOpener clicks Claude's\n   Browser button, types localhost:4747\n→ menu page reads /games.json\n→ click a card → game site opens\n\n③ Ask Claude\n\"add murdoku.com to my games\"\n→ add_game tool → socket → GameList\n\"open game\" → open_game → menu URL\n\n④ Claude Code session ends\nStop hook → hook.js → socket \"react\"\n→ pet hops: \"Done! · project\"\n\n⑤ Shutdown\nClaude quits, or no MCP server\nconnected for 20s → app exits\n\nPet input: click = hearts · double-click\n= throw ball · right-click = console",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 5,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
